1. NON-NEGOTIABLE PROJECT REQUIREMENTS

==================================================

Follow these requirements throughout development.

Build a complete software-only web application.
Do not require any hardware.
Do not require IoT devices.
Do not require Arduino, Raspberry Pi, microcontrollers or sensors.
Do not require physical machine connectivity.
Do not require RFID, GPS, CCTV or external industrial equipment.
Do not introduce unnecessary LLM, RAG or machine learning dependencies.
Use transparent rule-based algorithms and operational analytics.
Simulated operational data is permitted, but clearly identify simulated information.
Every major feature must be functional.
All four login dashboards must use the same connected backend and database.
Changes made by one login must appear in the relevant dashboards of other authorized users.
Implement proper role-based access control.
