FACTORY SETUP
→ WORKFORCE REGISTRATION
→ SHIFT PLANNING
→ RESOURCE ALLOCATION
→ PRODUCTION MANAGEMENT
→ OPERATIONAL MONITORING
→ SAFETY MANAGEMENT
→ FAULT REPORTING
→ MAINTENANCE
